---
// ProblemSolution.astro
---

<section id="problem" class="section-padding problem-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="badge">The Missing Piece in Modern Browsing</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Why browser bookmarks <span class="gradient-text">aren't enough anymore</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Web applications evolved from static pages into complex interactive software. Browser bookmarks remained stuck in 1995.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-grid">
      <!-- Traditional Bookmarks Card -->
      <div class="glass-card comp-card comp-old">
        <div class="comp-badge old-badge">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
            <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
          </svg>
          <span>Standard Browser Bookmarks</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="comp-title">Only remembers where you were, not what you did</h3>

        <ul class="comp-list">
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="cross-icon">✕</span>
            <span><strong>Loses dropdown selections</strong> & dynamic select menus</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="cross-icon">✕</span>
            <span><strong>Wipes custom date ranges</strong> on reporting analytics</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="cross-icon">✕</span>
            <span><strong>Resets table filters</strong>, checkbox facets, and sort toggles</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="cross-icon">✕</span>
            <span><strong>Forces 30–60 seconds</strong> of tedious manual clicking on every visit</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="cross-icon">✕</span>
            <span><strong>Fails on client-rendered SPA forms</strong> that don't serialize into URL bars</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- StickySite Card -->
      <div class="glass-card comp-card comp-new">
        <div class="comp-badge new-badge">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>StickySite Smart View Presets</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="comp-title">Restores your exact interactive configuration</h3>

        <ul class="comp-list">
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Scans interactive form controls</strong>, text inputs, radios & dropdowns</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span><strong>One-click instant restoration</strong> with real-time feedback</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Smart cross-page navigation</strong>: visits target URL then applies presets</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Multi-view manager</strong>: save multiple presets per site (e.g., "Q3 Open Bugs")</span>
          </li>
          <li class="comp-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Selective capture review</strong>: toggle off any field before saving</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    position: relative;
  }

  .comparison-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .comp-card {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .comp-old {
    border-color: #fecaca;
    background: #fffafa;
  }

  .comp-new {
    border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
  }

  .comp-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .old-badge {
    background: #fee2e2;
    color: #b91c1c;
    border: 1px solid #fca5a5;
  }

  .new-badge {
    background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
    color: #4338ca;
    border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
  }

  .comp-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .comp-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .comp-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .comp-item strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cross-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fee2e2;
    color: #dc2626;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .check-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #d1fae5;
    color: #059669;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .comparison-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
